Deliberately EXCLUDED (license-incompatible with Apache-2.0 — never bundled):
- xView2 / xBD (building-damage imagery+labels) ... CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 → evaluation/model-only, not shipped.
- Georgia Tech IODA (internet-outage measurement) .. "Copyright © 2021-2025 Georgia Tech Research
